  "title": "Karaage Chicken Sandwich",
  "description": "Savory miso mayonnaise and an Asian-inspired slaw top these Japanese karaage chicken sandwiches, fried crunchy and served on toasted potato buns.",
  "authors": [
    "Curtis Williams"
  ],
